[P1a] exact 4-link SU(2) (|X_l|~0.35, Richardson 2nd difference of 1-1/2 Re tr U_p):
   n=600   consistency |d2(0.01)-d2(0.02)| max = 1.654e-05  (|Q|max=3.626e-01)
   alpha=Re tr(U H^2)/tr H^2 : min= 0.427990 max= 0.997996 frac<0=0.0000
   Q_geom(unit ||v||^2)      : min=-3.626286e-01 max= 3.275827e-01 mean=-2.201399e-02 frac<0=0.5883
   identity (exact algebra): d_v^2(1-1/2 Re tr U_p) = 1/2 Re tr[U_p(W_p^2 + Wdot_p)], W_p=U_p^{-1}U_p'
                            = 1/2 tr(H_p^2)[alpha_p - gamma_p],  H_p=iW_p, gamma_p=Re tr(U_p Wdot_p)/tr H_p^2
   => Q_geom is INDEFINITE pointwise (Savvidy). H_vv = beta*Q_geom is NOT >=0 free.

